# Data: downloaded papers, parsed text, vector and evidence databases
data/*
!data/README.md
# The model-answer cache is committed so the notebook can replay every model call without an endpoint.
# It holds prompts and answers only (no endpoint address or key, checked 2026-11-21).
!data/llm_cache.sqlite
# Small evidence files a fresh run cannot make (metadata and extracted values, no paper text, no address or key):
# the frozen paper selections, the submitted Checkpoint 3.1 demo, its citation check, and the earlier runs that
# 8.12 and 8.13 compare against.
!data/crossref_check.json
!data/papers/
data/papers/*
!data/papers/selection.json
!data/papers/library_v2.json
!data/papers/library_ext.json
!data/papers/library_ext2.json
